          "title": "Abstract Classes and the Template Method",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Skeleton",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Template method==: the base class owns the **algorithm skeleton** in a concrete method",
                "Subclasses override only the {blue:varying steps}",
                "Java: `final` stops subclasses overriding the skeleton"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "load()",
                    "sub": "fixed",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "format()",
                    "sub": "abstract",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "save()",
                    "sub": "fixed",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "abstract class Report {",
                "  final void generate() {",
                "    load(); format(); save();",
                "  }",
                "  abstract void format();",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "Java"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "python",
              "lines": [
                "class Report(ABC):",
                "    def generate(self):",
                "        self.load(); self.format(); self.save()",
                "    @abstractmethod",
                "    def format(self): ..."
              ],
              "note": "Python"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Hook Methods",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Hook== = optional step with an empty or default body",
                "Subclasses **may** override it, e.g. `beforeSave()`",
                "Abstract step: must override. Hook: may override"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Overridable call in a **constructor**: subclass fields are not initialised yet",
                "Python has no `final`: document it or use `typing.final`"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "The skeleton is ==fixed==; only the steps ==vary==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
